  "title": "Multimodal Accessibility of Documents",
  "abstract": "To ensure that people with print disability are able equally to participate in society, it is crucial to develop more effective ways for the accessibility of both printed and electronic documents. In this chapter we have first presented an integrated architecture on how a document is structured. Then, the existing international standards and guidelines for creating accessible documents were briefly analyzed. Based on these, we have proposed a novel holistic XMLbased system for the real time production, presentation and navigation of multimodal accessible documents.",
